Grow and cut text before a scrolled window's origin and selection, exercising the
per-layer origin/p0/p1 adjustment in hgrow/hdata1/hcut.

-- input --
growdata 0 0 0123456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz ABCDEFGHIJ\n
origin 0 5
setdot 0 15 20
grow 0 1 2
data 0 1 ..
cut 0 0 2
-- waitframes --
56 62 78 82 82 82 82
-- drawops --
JIqbbAbddbbbbdbbbbdbbbYbilbbd{5}bbd{28}l{46}ddxd{18}x
